elevision\" class=\"entity-link\">Game of Thrones Television</a></li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Game of Thrones connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Series:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/books/a-song-of-ice-and-fire\" class=\"entity-link\">A Song of Ice and Fire</a>\n            — The novels were adapted into Game of Thrones.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Faction:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/hbo\" class=\"entity-link\">HBO</a>\n            — <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/hbo\" class=\"entity-link\">HBO</a> produced Game of Thrones.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Location:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/westeros\" class=\"entity-link\">Westeros</a>\n            — <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/westeros\" class=\"entity-link\">Westeros</a> is the primary setting of Game of Thrones.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Creator:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/george-rr-martin\" class=\"entity-link\">George R.R. Martin</a>\n            — Martin created the world adapted as Game of Thrones.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Topic:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/television\" class=\"entity-link\">Game of Thrones Television</a>\n            — <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/television\" class=\"entity-link\">Game of Thrones Television</a> is a medium branch of Game of Thrones.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Topic:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/books\" class=\"entity-link\">A Song of Ice and Fire</a>\n            — <a href=\"/game-of-thrones/books/a-song-of-ice-and-fire\" class=\"entity-link\">A Song of Ice and Fire</a> is a medium branch of Game of Throne